OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786915123
OL,3,CRoad closures in Birmingham for the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletic Championships
OL,5,Cmarathon
OL,7,FDrivers are being warned of massive
OL,8,Froad closures in Birmingham city
OL,9,Fcentre this weekend as the European
OL,10,FAthletic Championships reaches it's
OL,11,Ffinal day in the city.
OL,13,FFor the first time ever, the European
OL,14,FAthletics Championships come to Great
OL,15,FBritain.
OL,17,FThousands of spectators and athletes
OL,18,Fhave been descending on the city
OL,19,Fthroughout the tournament, with many
OL,20,Fof them enjoying the fan parks across
OL,21,Fthe city.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/12
