OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786915123
OL,3,CRoad closures in Birmingham for the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletic Championships
OL,5,Cmarathon
OL,7,FMany roads around the city centre and
OL,8,Fthe Jewellery Quarter will shut down
OL,9,Fto safely allow the European Athletics
OL,10,FChampionships to host the marathon
OL,11,Fhappening tomorrow.
OL,13,FFull list of road closures on Sunday
OL,14,F16 August
OL,16,FAll closed 3am to 1pm
OL,18,FBerkley Street
OL,20,FBridge Street
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/12
